<title>FINLAND: TAMPELLA PROPOSES NAM SWITCH TO TAMROCK.</title>
<headline>TAMPELLA PROPOSES NAM SWITCH TO TAMROCK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish engineering group Tampella Oy said in a statement on Tuesday its board was proposing that the company be renamed Tamrock Oy.</p>
<p>&quot;Tampella's board has decided to call an extraordinary shareholders' meeting to decide about a change of the company's name to Tamrock Oy,&quot; Tampella said.</p>
</text>
